r#  49846  932  19
p: .
t. 
|  Otherwise we refer to all court-appointed representatives for minor children in
|  family court litigation as law guardians.2. Lidman and Hollingsworth, The Guardian Ad Litem in Child Custody Cases,
.  pp. 255, 256, n. 4

--- Sentence/end 
