|  major depression in community mental health settings
|  so as to reduce racial disparities in schizophrenia diagnoses (p. 130). See Gara et al., A Naturalistic Study
.  of Racial Disparities in Diagnoses at an Outpatient Behavioral Health Clinic.71. Palos Hospital Report, May 28, 2018, pp. 10--11

