|  120. Personal communication between one of the authors and the mother, February
|  11, 2022. The mother’s concerns about the father’s apparent preoccupation with
.  changing his daughter’s clothes warrants consideration particularly among mental health professionals. This issue undoubtedly is beyond the scope of this book


